WEBVTT

00:04:58.015 --> 00:05:00.457
So this kind of dual signaling
simultaneously

00:05:00.481 --> 00:05:02.631
with a changing behavioral context

00:05:02.655 --> 00:05:04.145
is really extraordinary.

00:05:04.169 --> 00:05:05.799
It takes a lot of brain power.

00:05:05.823 --> 00:05:08.357
Now, another way
to look at this is that, hmm,

00:05:08.381 --> 00:05:12.174
maybe we have 50 million years
of evidence for the two-faced male.

00:05:12.198 --> 00:05:16.204
(Laughter)

00:05:17.188 --> 00:05:18.740
All right, let's move on.

00:05:18.764 --> 00:05:19.821
(Laughter)

00:05:19.845 --> 00:05:22.650
An octopus on a coral reef
has a tough job in front it

00:05:22.674 --> 00:05:26.370
to go to so many places,
remember and find its den.

00:05:26.394 --> 00:05:27.937
And they do this extremely well.

00:05:27.961 --> 00:05:29.804
They have short- and long-term memory,

00:05:29.828 --> 00:05:31.920
they learn things
in three to five trials --